1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,000
The Clover Kingdom.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,000
In this place where magic is everything,

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,000
there lives one boy who was born without it.

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,000
His name is Asta.

5
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:15,000
His strength and determination helped him become a magic knight.

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
And despite the many challenges he faces,

7
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,000
he aims for the top and refuses to give up.

8
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Rich or poor, royalty or commoner,

9
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Asta believes anyone can shine.

10
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:32,000
His mission is to prove that to the whole world

11
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:36,000
and to become the next Wizard King.

12
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:39,000
The Black Bulls traveled to Rockway for trading,

13
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:42,000
hoping to fortify their magic skills.

14
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:45,000
There, Asta and Noel reunited with Kahono and Kieto

15
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,000
and were called upon to solve a problem

16
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:50,000
that was brewing under the waves.

17
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,000
A guardian of the sea had gone on a rampage,

18
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:56,000
posing a deadly threat to the people of the Underwater Temple.

19
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:01,000
Noelle and a few of the others took to the water to quell the chaos.

20
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:12,000
I'll keep getting stronger, Mom. Watch me. I'm just getting started.

21
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:19,000
But, Noel wasn't the only member of the Black Bulls who had vowed to become stronger.

22
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:30,000
What is this?

23
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:34,000
Apparently these foods are supposed to explosively enhance mana.

24
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:37,000
Sounds interesting. I didn't know you could make food like that.

25
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:39,000
Alright, down the hatch.

26
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:42,000
Not sure what you expect to happen since you don't have any magic.

27
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:45,000
I don't know! Maybe it'll make my anti-magic better somehow!

28
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:46,000
It's worth a try, right?

29
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:48,000
Time to dig in!

30
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:50,000
Time to dig in!

31
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:55,000
Oof

32
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:57,000
Whoa! It feels like it's already working!

33
00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:59,000
Yeah, my mana is flowing like a waterfall!

34
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:02,000
What the hell's going on?!

35
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:06,000
AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA!!!

36
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:13,000
This is some powerful sauce, man!

37
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:14,760
Leave me there, you guys!

38
00:02:14,920 --> 00:02:16,460
I wonder what was in that food.

39
00:02:18,220 --> 00:02:20,160
Oh, no, it's all three of them!

40
00:02:23,920 --> 00:02:26,460
Hey! Charmy, do something!

41
00:02:26,860 --> 00:02:28,000
Somebody's gonna get hurt!

42
00:02:29,480 --> 00:02:31,720
That food wasn't good enough.

43
00:02:31,720 --> 00:02:33,120
You guys chill, you'll rush out!

44
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:35,600
I know. I'll go see him.

45
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:50,000
Oh, no, it's all three of them!

46
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:52,000
Oh, no, it's all three of them!

47
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:54,000
Oh, no, it's all three of them!

48
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:56,000
Oh, no, it's all three of them!

49
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:58,000
Oh, no, it's all three of them!

50
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:00,000
Yeah, yeah!

51
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:07,000
強く風吹く世界の果てで

52
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:12,000
僕らは今日も目を閉じる夢を見る飽きもせず

53
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:17,000
今は小さく儚い希望も

54
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:23,000
いつか時代を変えてゆく光になると信じて

55
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:27,000
背負うべきものなど何一つないさ

56
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:30,000
全て抱きしめてゆく

57
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:35,000
たとえばそれが痛みだとしても

58
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:40,000
叶うなら君と共に

59
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:45,000
この声がこの喉が振り切れるほど

60
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:47,000
今叫ぶよ

61
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:51,000
未来は自分で切り開くんだって

62
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:55,000
とめとなく溢れ出る情熱のままさ

63
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:58,000
歩き出そう

64
00:03:58,000 --> 00:04:03,000
To fill my dream

65
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:14,000
ご視聴ありがとうございました

66
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:15,000
You want me to train you?

67
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:17,000
ねぇ

68
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:18,000
ねぇ

69
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:20,000
ねぇ

70
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:21,000
消せPCON

71
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:45,000
消費

72
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:48,000
That allows me to cook meals that recover a person's mana.

73
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:50,000
But that isn't enough!

74
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:53,000
I need to whip up something that'll kick my friend's magic into overdrive!

75
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:57,000
Ah, I see. That's not going to be an easy task.

76
00:04:57,000 --> 00:05:00,000
Hope you're ready to work hard, Shortcake.

77
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:02,000
You know it!

78
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:16,000
986! 987!

79
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:18,000
These sheep cooks are your magic.

80
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:21,000
But you can't simply work on making them stronger.

81
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:23,000
That isn't going to give you the result you're after.

82
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:27,000
The only way to make that happen is to put aside your magic

83
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:30,000
and concentrate on training beyond your physical limits

84
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:33,000
so you and the sheep cooks will have what it takes

85
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:35,000
to create the food that can enhance mana.

86
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:36,000
99!

87
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:37,000
1!

88
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:39,000
1000!

89
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:45,000
Your stamina's much better.

90
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:46,000
According to this book,

91
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:49,000
the next thing you need to do is gather some unknown ingredients.

92
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:52,000
Three items so rare, even I've never seen them.

93
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:55,000
That's pretty vague, but leave it to me, sir.

94
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:05,000
First, we need the bulb of a Mentan Pin Mandoradora.

95
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:07,000
Got it!

96
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:11,000
Next, hunt down the no one's heard of this coelacanth.

97
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:17,000
And lastly, the butt hide of a surprise Squatch.

98
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:19,000
Give me your butt fluff!

99
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:23,000
Shortcake did what?

100
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:25,000
Are you kidding me?

101
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:26,000
It's her!

102
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:39,000
Why did you push that hard?

103
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:40,000
Master!

104
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:44,000
I did what you said, and now…

105
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:54,000
My Charmy Papitsen will create the most powerful mana-enhancing dishes that have ever existed in this world.

106
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:57,000
Tonight, I'll cook up a feast for all my friends.

107
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:06,000
So whatever this is, it'll enhance everyone's mana.

108
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:09,000
Um, why do I have to be a part of this?

109
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:11,000
Because we need an escape plan if things go south.

110
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:14,000
Wait, what's gonna go south?

111
00:07:14,000 --> 00:07:17,000
Charmy must have worked really hard to make this food.

112
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:19,000
Eat it!

113
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:22,000
You know what? I'm stuffed.

114
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:24,000
Yeah, I'm not hungry.

115
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:26,000
We should go. Thanks, Charmy.

116
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:28,000
Guys, please, we have to eat it!

117
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:32,000
We gotta show Charmy that she didn't do all of this for no reason!

118
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:34,000
I beg you to stay!

119
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:37,000
This meal was made by the shi-

120
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:43,000
No, Charmy, after she risked her life to obtain the ingredients to enhance her friend's magic!

121
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:46,000
Wait, who the heck is this guy?

122
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:48,000
Master!

123
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:50,000
I'll stop!

124
00:07:50,000 --> 00:08:00,000
You see that? Demon food!

125
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:04,000
I don't think you cooked this enough!

126
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:08,000
Don't worry! Spatial magic, Fallen Angel Gate!

127
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:15,000
What are you bozos doing?

128
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:17,000
Captain Yummy?

129
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:21,000
You better not be running off with my wheels. What if I need to go to the bathroom?

130
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:24,000
Sorry, sir, but you just have to hold it in!

131
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:26,000
Huh?

132
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:29,000
That looks bad.

133
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:35,000
I knew it! It's demon food!

134
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:36,000
No, not demon food!

135
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:38,000
You just made that up, didn't you?

136
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:41,000
Why don't you cut the crap and be straight with us?

137
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:43,000
Is that someone we know, or...?

138
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:50,000
I've never seen it firsthand, but legend has it a massive amount of mana combined with the love of a devoted friend can cause food to come to life!

139
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:51,000
It absolutely can't!

140
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:54,000
No? Then how else would you explain what's happening?

141
00:08:54,000 --> 00:08:59,000
Charlie's desire to improve her squadmate's magic power was as pure and genuine as it gets!

142
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:02,000
That's how the food she made ended up so jam-packed with mana!

143
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:04,000
There was nothing else that could have caused it!

144
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:07,000
My food's an evil monster?

145
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:11,000
Hey, are you okay?

146
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:13,000
Oh man, it's got me!

147
00:09:14,000 --> 00:09:15,000
Magna!

148
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:18,000
I don't know why, but my body feels really weak now.

149
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:19,000
Look!

150
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:21,000
It's draining away our mana.

151
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:23,000
How is this even possible?

152
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:26,000
That's what makes demon food such a deadly threat!

153
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:29,000
It absorbs mana from everyone in the vicinity until it becomes unstoppable!

154
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:32,000
No, really, who are you?

155
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:34,000
I worked so hard on those noms!

156
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:37,000
Hey kid! Quit daydreaming already!

157
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:42,000
That thing is using mana and you've got an anti-magic sword!

158
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:44,000
Do you need me to spell it out for you?

159
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:46,000
It's just that...

160
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:47,000
Fine.

161
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:51,000
Guess I'll take care of it.

162
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:55,000
I'd like to think I could count on my squad to clean up their own messes, but here we are!

163
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:56,000
No, don't!

164
00:09:57,000 --> 00:09:58,000
Huh?

165
00:09:58,000 --> 00:10:00,000
You wanna explain yourself?

166
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:04,000
Captain, we can't just destroy the food Charmy worked so hard to make us!

167
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:07,000
Hey, wait! That's right! It's food!

168
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:09,000
Yeah, I thought we covered that.

169
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:12,000
Please, Hofsta!

170
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:17,000
Stop it! You have to!

171
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:22,000
Okay.

172
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:35,000
This meal was a labor of love, and I'm not gonna let it go away!

173
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:44,000
That'll come out of both ends later.

174
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:49,000
Feels like my mana's recharging.

175
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:53,000
Oh yeah, it's flowing out of the party's gnawing arm.

176
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:55,000
Not so fast, Hofsta!

177
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:57,000
I'm not letting you eat at all!

178
00:10:58,000 --> 00:10:59,000
Ha!

179
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:04,000
Bet you want a piece of the action too, don't you buddy?

180
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:06,000
Obviously!

181
00:11:07,000 --> 00:11:09,000
Alright, I want the rest of you to help them polish it off.

182
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:11,000
Shouldn't take too long if you all contribute.

183
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:13,000
But I'm just the transport!

184
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:14,000
And this is beneath me.

185
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:15,000
Aaaaaaahhh!

186
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:22,000
Dude!

187
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:23,000
Who are you?

188
00:11:27,000 --> 00:11:32,000
And there you go! Good job, fatsos!

189
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:34,620
And there you go. Good job, fatsoes.

190
00:11:34,980 --> 00:11:36,440
They did it to themselves.

191
00:11:37,740 --> 00:11:39,280
Hey, I meant to tell you.

192
00:11:40,280 --> 00:11:45,500
I feel like that food was different than what you usually cook, and I don't just mean the part where it tried to kill us.

193
00:11:46,640 --> 00:11:50,160
It's kind of hard for me to put into words, but I don't know.

194
00:11:50,220 --> 00:11:53,000
It seemed like the only reason you made it was to build up our mana.

195
00:11:53,820 --> 00:11:58,160
When I eat your food, I can usually taste how much you care about making people happy and stuffed.

196
00:11:58,680 --> 00:12:00,700
I just felt like that was missing this time.

197
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:04,580
Whoa, that came out really rude. I'm sorry.

198
00:12:05,440 --> 00:12:06,080
Mustard?

199
00:12:06,620 --> 00:12:08,700
Hmm. That's a good point.

200
00:12:08,920 --> 00:12:13,300
In our quest to cook the perfect meal, we forgot the most important thing about being a chef.

201
00:12:14,280 --> 00:12:17,760
Charmy. No, I mean shortcake. One more try!

202
00:12:18,180 --> 00:12:19,460
I'm ready, sir!

203
00:12:19,460 --> 00:12:33,140
Let's do it again!

204
00:12:33,700 --> 00:12:34,920
Here goes!

205
00:12:34,920 --> 00:12:40,020
Give me another!

206
00:12:42,700 --> 00:12:45,800
Lately, I spend most days surrounded by friends.

207
00:12:46,800 --> 00:12:51,060
I'm extremely happy. Possibly happier than I've ever been in my life.

208
00:12:51,060 --> 00:12:57,080
Our battle with the devil is fast approaching, and we have to win.

209
00:12:58,020 --> 00:13:00,880
If we fail, then our happy days will be over.

210
00:13:01,720 --> 00:13:03,940
I thought that last one was pretty good.

211
00:13:04,180 --> 00:13:04,560
Asta.

212
00:13:04,840 --> 00:13:05,040
Huh?

213
00:13:05,780 --> 00:13:09,440
Do you think that I could train with you for a little bit?

214
00:13:09,580 --> 00:13:11,120
Yeah, of course you can!

215
00:13:11,340 --> 00:13:13,400
Hey, Noelle, is it cool if Gordon tags in for you?

216
00:13:13,440 --> 00:13:14,240
Uh, sure.

217
00:13:14,240 --> 00:13:17,400
Give me everything you got!

218
00:13:18,140 --> 00:13:18,460
Okay.

219
00:13:19,300 --> 00:13:19,940
My best?

220
00:13:20,480 --> 00:13:22,920
I didn't plan to do that, but...

221
00:13:22,920 --> 00:13:24,700
I'm sure Asta can handle it.

222
00:13:25,480 --> 00:13:26,680
Alright, here I go.

223
00:13:27,340 --> 00:13:29,940
Poison Curse Magic, Dwelling of the Poison Cloud!

224
00:13:38,940 --> 00:13:42,920
Oh, sorry, Gordon. Are you okay?

225
00:13:42,920 --> 00:13:44,580
As I expected.

226
00:13:46,020 --> 00:13:47,560
I'm no match for you.

227
00:13:54,440 --> 00:13:56,660
I was fighting with all I had.

228
00:13:59,100 --> 00:14:01,280
Maybe I've been getting weaker of late.

229
00:14:03,040 --> 00:14:06,360
When I first met the team, I was truly alone.

230
00:14:06,360 --> 00:14:13,460
But that was largely because I was as sharp as a knife, and I refused to let anyone get close to me.

231
00:14:14,660 --> 00:14:17,480
And now, I've lost my edge.

232
00:14:17,480 --> 00:14:30,800
I love it here with my friends, but I can't remain complacent.

233
00:14:31,300 --> 00:14:35,380
If we're going to defeat the devil, I must regain the strength I had in the past.

234
00:14:37,980 --> 00:14:41,420
And that means I've got no choice but to be alone again.

235
00:14:41,420 --> 00:14:57,880
Lady Mariliona sure is powerful, and she got that way by walking through a strong magic region on her own when she was young.

236
00:14:57,880 --> 00:15:03,140
So I'll cross the forest of poisonous magical beasts near the forest of witches.

237
00:15:04,140 --> 00:15:10,420
I thought it over, and the strong magic region's a little too scary for me, so I'll stick with this.

238
00:15:10,420 --> 00:15:15,440
Things are going well so far.

239
00:15:15,920 --> 00:15:18,280
I knew living my life alone was the best idea.

240
00:15:19,060 --> 00:15:20,580
Okay, time for a break.

241
00:15:23,020 --> 00:15:24,160
I'm a little hungry.

242
00:15:25,400 --> 00:15:25,720
Huh?

243
00:15:31,460 --> 00:15:33,220
That's my food for the whole week!

244
00:15:35,320 --> 00:15:35,760
Wait!

245
00:15:35,760 --> 00:15:35,820
Wait!

246
00:15:40,420 --> 00:15:47,900
I still can't find my bag.

247
00:15:48,740 --> 00:15:50,080
Maybe I'll go home now.

248
00:15:50,620 --> 00:15:52,620
I've probably been alone long enough.

249
00:15:54,580 --> 00:15:55,360
Uh-oh.

250
00:15:56,140 --> 00:15:58,100
I don't know how to get back.

251
00:16:06,320 --> 00:16:08,440
Eating by yourself isn't as good.

252
00:16:10,420 --> 00:16:14,400
Our meals together were always loud and rowdy, but I had fun.

253
00:16:15,920 --> 00:16:19,160
I really wish my friends were here to help me get through this.

254
00:16:24,580 --> 00:16:25,620
Don't worry, Gordon.

255
00:16:25,780 --> 00:16:27,980
I'll find you something to snack on right away!

256
00:16:28,660 --> 00:16:30,440
We're the GG guys, remember?

257
00:16:30,860 --> 00:16:32,220
Pull yourself together, buddy.

258
00:16:32,220 --> 00:16:34,820
You look so tired, it's scary!

259
00:16:35,120 --> 00:16:35,560
Yeek!

260
00:16:36,360 --> 00:16:37,900
Be tough like me, dude!

261
00:16:38,040 --> 00:16:39,300
I know you can do it!

262
00:16:39,820 --> 00:16:42,100
Forget Magna, I'm gonna kill you!

263
00:16:44,040 --> 00:16:46,380
Great, I'm already starting to go crazy!

264
00:16:46,380 --> 00:16:56,160
Now's my chance.

265
00:16:56,560 --> 00:16:59,580
Let's see how much stronger I've gotten since I left the Black Bulls.

266
00:17:02,080 --> 00:17:03,280
Poison Curse Magic.

267
00:17:03,620 --> 00:17:05,140
Dwelling of the Poison Cloud!

268
00:17:05,140 --> 00:17:13,120
I'll try again.

269
00:17:18,380 --> 00:17:19,380
No good!

270
00:17:19,380 --> 00:17:27,700
My Poison Curse Magic didn't work.

271
00:17:28,180 --> 00:17:29,700
Guess I'm weaker than I thought.

272
00:17:29,700 --> 00:17:40,700
This is the first water I've found in three whole days.

273
00:17:41,700 --> 00:17:44,100
I can live here by myself for a while.

274
00:17:44,740 --> 00:17:47,320
I'll hunt for food alone, sleep alone,

275
00:17:47,320 --> 00:17:50,880
and wash my face alone just like this.

276
00:17:51,960 --> 00:17:52,960
Back at the hideout,

277
00:17:53,500 --> 00:17:55,940
Asta and I would always wash each other's backs.

278
00:17:55,940 --> 00:18:00,680
Some nights I'd drink with Vanessa while we talked about our dreams.

279
00:18:02,400 --> 00:18:05,420
Ghosh let me help take care of his Marie doll every once in a while.

280
00:18:07,360 --> 00:18:09,880
And Luck and I would fight almost to the death.

281
00:18:12,820 --> 00:18:14,800
I must improve myself.

282
00:18:15,640 --> 00:18:18,760
But the thought of being alone has become so painful,

283
00:18:19,400 --> 00:18:22,660
even though that was normal for me before I joined the Black Bulls.

284
00:18:22,660 --> 00:18:26,280
I wonder what my friends are up to tonight.

285
00:18:29,000 --> 00:18:30,160
This is nuts.

286
00:18:30,660 --> 00:18:32,580
We need to get a move on right now.

287
00:18:33,040 --> 00:18:34,940
Come on, there's no time to lose.

288
00:18:35,040 --> 00:18:35,740
Yes, sir!

289
00:18:39,040 --> 00:18:40,280
They'll come looking for me.

290
00:18:40,560 --> 00:18:41,960
I just have to trust them.

291
00:18:44,000 --> 00:18:46,020
You guys, you found me already?

292
00:18:46,020 --> 00:18:53,940
That must be the smaller one's mother.

293
00:18:59,320 --> 00:19:00,360
This is nuts.

294
00:19:00,740 --> 00:19:02,420
We gotta get a move on right now.

295
00:19:03,460 --> 00:19:05,160
Come on, there's no time to lose.

296
00:19:05,260 --> 00:19:05,940
Yes, sir!

297
00:19:12,360 --> 00:19:13,420
Poison curse magic.

298
00:19:13,840 --> 00:19:14,860
How fucking ducks!

299
00:19:16,020 --> 00:19:18,840
It's no use.

300
00:19:19,280 --> 00:19:21,520
My magic isn't affecting these things at all.

301
00:19:33,020 --> 00:19:33,920
This is it.

302
00:19:34,340 --> 00:19:37,200
I'm going to die alone without my friends at my side.

303
00:19:37,200 --> 00:19:38,200
No.

304
00:19:43,020 --> 00:19:43,480
Wait.

305
00:19:43,480 --> 00:19:47,780
The Black Bulls didn't abandon me after all.

306
00:19:49,180 --> 00:19:50,700
I understand now.

307
00:19:51,280 --> 00:19:53,320
I don't need solitude to make me stronger.

308
00:19:54,140 --> 00:19:54,460
No.

309
00:19:54,860 --> 00:19:57,720
I'm strong because of the bond I share with them.

310
00:19:59,380 --> 00:20:01,700
Loneliness is the deadliest poison of all.

311
00:20:02,320 --> 00:20:04,380
And the only antidote that cures it

312
00:20:04,380 --> 00:20:07,240
is the love of my dear friends.

313
00:20:07,240 --> 00:20:22,140
I'm so sorry.

314
00:20:22,580 --> 00:20:26,560
I allowed fear to take over and I wrongfully attacked you and your little one.

315
00:20:26,560 --> 00:20:30,340
As a magic knight who's been tasked with protecting this land,

316
00:20:30,420 --> 00:20:32,300
that's a mistake that can never be forgiven.

317
00:20:33,160 --> 00:20:36,120
You're my allies and fellow residents of the Clover Kingdom.

318
00:20:36,780 --> 00:20:37,340
What's more,

319
00:20:37,860 --> 00:20:39,440
you're my friends too.

320
00:20:39,440 --> 00:20:53,700
Thanks for leading the way.

321
00:20:53,700 --> 00:20:59,260
I see.

322
00:20:59,260 --> 00:21:02,620
The two of you have an immunity to the type of magic that I use.

323
00:21:03,360 --> 00:21:05,660
So that's why my spells didn't do anything.

324
00:21:05,660 --> 00:21:13,300
I'm home.

325
00:21:15,040 --> 00:21:15,600
Oh.

326
00:21:16,800 --> 00:21:18,180
What great friends.

327
00:21:18,700 --> 00:21:20,360
They must have gone out to look for me.

328
00:21:21,240 --> 00:21:23,720
There's no telling what kind of trouble they might be in.

329
00:21:23,720 --> 00:21:27,420
Now it's my turn to go rescue them.

330
00:21:28,140 --> 00:21:31,420
I swear I'll never leave my dear friends behind again.

331
00:21:33,680 --> 00:21:34,860
Totally awesome.

332
00:21:35,240 --> 00:21:40,240
I want all of you to push past your limits by stuffing your faces tonight.

333
00:21:40,580 --> 00:21:42,080
It's your first time's mine.

334
00:21:42,360 --> 00:21:42,900
Hey, boss.

335
00:21:43,460 --> 00:21:46,020
Is it me or is everybody staring at us?

336
00:21:46,160 --> 00:21:46,860
Who cares?

337
00:21:47,120 --> 00:21:49,960
Apparently they're trying to sell off their excess ingredients right now,

338
00:21:49,960 --> 00:21:55,820
which means we can eat as much grub as we want and get 90% off our bill.

339
00:21:55,820 --> 00:21:56,160
Woo!

340
00:21:56,160 --> 00:21:56,180
Woo!

341
00:22:25,820 --> 00:22:27,260
We won't do two more.

342
00:22:28,080 --> 00:22:29,360
It's our first time.

343
00:22:29,400 --> 00:22:31,720
We forgot to try and run out with us.

344
00:22:32,300 --> 00:22:33,580
Why don't you lose so many sweets?

345
00:22:33,960 --> 00:22:35,240
Because we've provided for us.

346
00:22:35,960 --> 00:22:42,140
And can you learn to make us so much going now?

347
00:22:42,420 --> 00:22:43,060
Helping overnight.

348
00:22:43,140 --> 00:22:55,660
The beenternutught we have to cutall

349
00:22:55,820 --> 00:23:05,820
正解のない道上 そこではきっと一人じゃない

350
00:23:05,820 --> 00:23:19,820
間違いを間違いで終わらせないで 涙を涙で拭わないで

351
00:23:19,820 --> 00:23:27,820
確信があるその心 重げんね

352
00:23:27,820 --> 00:23:31,820
ここならもう一人じゃない

353
00:23:49,820 --> 00:23:59,820
涙を涙で拭わないで

354
00:23:59,820 --> 00:24:03,820
涙を涙で拭わないで

